From: clawd20130 <clawd20130@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 19:04:03 +0900
Subject: Android host: an agent workspace's KWin has no phone output

--android-workspace (with --android-host): the KWin of an agent workspace creates no output of
its own; its only output is the one the host offers it on its ws-<n> socket (a cast output that
only this client sees), where its fullscreen window is shown on the TV or fullscreen presenter.

Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-29
X-Rungic-Status: Pending
X-Rungic-Tests: none (gap)
X-Rungic-Docs: docs/research/91
